       functions.  In order to be a consistent set of functions, at least the
       following functions must be implemented: OOSSSSLL__FFUUNNCC__kkddff__nneewwccttxx(()),
       OOSSSSLL__FFUUNNCC__kkddff__ffrreeeeccttxx(()), OOSSSSLL__FFUUNNCC__kkddff__sseett__ccttxx__ppaarraammss(()),
